      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shar Vahl, Divided [zone=1310]\n**Who:**\n- Cook Yalkiin (NoS) [ _Quests & Baking Supplies_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 120\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Large Scorpion Tail [item=145275]\n- Rockhopper Steak [item=145148]\n- Xakra Steak [item=145274]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a scorpion [npc=57935]\n- a xakra worm [npc=57941]\n- a young rockhopper [npc=57942]\n- a young scorpion [npc=57943]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Shar Vahl, Divided (10 Points) [quest=12236]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 19:14:18 2022\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Cook Yalkiin in Shar Vahl, Divided. You can find him at /waypoint -159, 447, -165. He is in the west area of the zone. He is on the find tool as well, CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Cook Yalkiin'\nCook Yalkiin says, 'Welcome to the palace kitchen! We supply all meals, from simple snacks to full feasts for the royalty and their guests, so we're kept on our toes day and night. Let us know if you need anything while you're visiting, or if you would like to [lend a hand].'\nYou say, 'I would like to lend a hand.'\nCook Yalkiin says, 'Oh. Oh! Great! As you may be aware, things are a little chaotic in the city right now. As a pick-me-up to others, I'm trying my hand at some experimental recipes I've had rattling around in my noggin. Could you try to get some [ingredients] for me?'\nYou say, 'What ingredients are you looking for?'\nCook Yalkiin says, 'There's a few meaty things I would like from the Pit below. First would be a handful of xakra meat, especially if you can get some thick, steak-like cuts. Second, try to get some cuts from the rockhoppers, particularly the leg meat. Lastly, if you find any particularly large scorpion tails, stingers attached, feel free to grab them, as well. Would that be [doable] for you?'\nYou say, 'That's doable. I can get them for you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Culinary Experimentation'.\nCook Yalkiin says, 'Excellent. I look forward to seeing what your hunt brings forth.'\n\n---\n\nIn an attempt to lighten the spirits of others around the Royal Palace, Cook Yalkin would like to test a few recipes that he's been thinking on. He's requested a few potential ingredients from the Pit surrounding the city.\nNote: these mobs are below the city go back to the a bridge and make your way down.\n1\\. Loot 4 Xakra Steaks from xakra worms in the Pit 0/4 Shar Vahl, Divided\n2\\. Loot 2 Rockhopper Steaks from rockhoppers in the Pit 0/2 Shar Vahl, Divided\n3\\. Loot 2 Large Scorpion Tails from scorpions in the Pit 0/2 Shar Vahl, Divided\n4\\. Deliver 4 Xakra Steaks to Cook Yalkiin 0/4 Shar Vahl, Divided\n5\\. Deliver 2 Rockhopper Steaks to Cook Yalkiin 0/2 Shar Vahl, Divided\n6\\. Deliver 2 Large Scorpion Tails to Cook Yalkiin 0/2 Shar Vahl, Divided\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n118 plat 5 silver 6 copper\nExperience",
