      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shar Vahl, Divided [zone=1310]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Expedition\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Shar Vahl, Divided: Mean Streets (Group) [zone=1312]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a riled up thug [npc=58633]\n- a shimmery chest [npc=58650]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Hero of Shar Vahl, Divided: Mean Streets (10 Points) [quest=12249]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 17:42:09 2022\nModified: Sun Mar 31 01:12:58 2024 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this mission from Sergeant Hujiid in Shar Vahl, Divided, she is located at /waypoint -418, 20, -188 not far from the city entrance on the south side of the city. She is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sergeant Hujiid'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'I am pleased to see you, Vanrau. Your fame precedes you and we are in need of assistance. The danger to our city has grown dramatically lately. You may have noticed that there are a lot of unhappy Vah Shir in Shar Vahl at the moment. This discontent has weakened us greatly, making the [threats] even greater.'\nYou say, 'threats'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'We have [unrest] in the city and an approaching [army] to contend with. However, the most immediate threat are the grimlings. They have grown even wilder than normal and raiding parties have been seen all over. Teaching them to fear the city again would certainly save lives. We can't spare the people with everything else that is going on, so I would be grateful if you could deal bring a show of force to the [grimlings] on behalf of Shar Vahl.'\nYou say, 'unrest'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'It's a complicated thing to explain. I'm not even sure how much of it all I don't understand. For years we have placed our people and our city first. But lately some groups have decided that what they want is more important that what other people want, even to the point of being willing to hurt others to get their way. It something I could never have predicted and something that I am ashamed to admit to. Our ancestors must be greatly displeased. Regardless, it is time to act. We have discovered that one of our citizens has been directly responsible for the death of at least one citizen and we need your help to bring him to justice. I won't lie to you, he is dangerous. If you will try to [bring him in] I can give you more information.'\nYou say, 'bring him in'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'The last decision is a tactical one. Can you bring with you a [significant] force or a more [flexible] but smaller group?'\nYou say, 'flexible'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'Thank you. We will need to clear some of the citizen from the area, but we can do that when you are [equipped] to take on this fight.'\nYou have received a request timer for 'Mean Streets': 0d:0h:1m remaining.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Mean Streets'.\nYou say, 'equipped'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'Let's go and see if we can do some good.'\n\n---\n\nSergeant Hujiid has asked you to help them deal with a Vah Shir that has been at the center of the unrest in the city. She warns that he is dangerous. Also, he has been seen all over the city at the same time by reliable witnesses. Clearly something is going on here.\n1\\. Defeat the street thug boss. 0/1 Shar Vahl, Divided\n2\\. ??? ???\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nAt Level 120 - 177p 8s 4cp\nExperience\n45 Shaded Specie\n\n---\n\nMean Streets - EverQuest Night of Shadows - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nMean Streets - EverQuest Night of Shadows jimmyw404\njimmyw404219 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Shaded Specie [item=145000]",
