      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shar Vahl, Divided [zone=1310]\n**Who:**\n- Sergeant Hujiid [ _Raids and Missions_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Expedition\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 04:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Shar Vahl, Divided: Under Siege (Group) [zone=1313]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Vius Vex [npc=58662]\n- a war chest - Under Siege [npc=58626]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Hero of Shar Vahl: Under Siege (10 Points) [quest=12264]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 17:43:37 2022\nModified: Sun Mar 31 01:25:13 2024 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis mission is given by Sergeant Hujiid in Shar Vahl, Divided.\nYou say, 'smaller'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'Great! We may have a chance with your assistance! Just let me know when you are [ **ready**] and I can send you where you're needed when they arrive.'\n_You have received a request timer for 'Under Siege': 0d:0h:1m remaining._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Under Siege'.\nYou say, 'ready'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'Let's go and see if we can do some good.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Shar Vahl: Under Siege.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Defeat Vius Vex. 0/1 (Shar Vahl, Divided)\n_Defeat the forces that are besieging Shar Vahl._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sergeant Hujiid'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'Greetings. Thank you for coming to help. You can see that our efforts have reduced their numbers, and yet the fiends persist. We can only hope that stopping them here will convince them to stay in their dreary temples and leave us alone. Our ancestors didn't spend their lives securing our home here for these akheva to take it from us. I have heard [ **tales**] that they believe that Luclin has sent them here to destroy us.'\nYou say, 'tales'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'It might have been you or one of your companions that told us that the akhevan priests claim to have seen the goddess herself walking through their rebuilt temple... Ka Vethan I think they call it. They chose to interpret this as a sign that they should conquer the entirety of Luclin. I don't believe this could have been the message she intended, if she even appeared before them at all. Ignoring the fact that the akheva don't have anyone's best interests in mind other than their own, Luclin is not a destroyer or conqueror. The akheva are only justifying their own desires. Our success against them so far should have clued them in. If their goddess was behind them, here on her world, we would have had no chance. Just because they tell themselves that they were created by Her does not make them sacred or special. And here, now, is when we teach them that. We will be ready when [ **they come**].\nYou say, 'they come'\nSergeant Hujiid says, 'Hah! Here they come. Almost as if our words have set them into motion!'\nThis event has three phases. There is some sort of timer that will start the next phase, ready or not.\nPhase 1\nKill the 2 Akhevans behind the rock NPCs. You can kill one at a time by staying close to the bridge wall.\nPhase 2\nKill the 2 Akhevans standing guard at the boss. These will both agro simultaneously.\nPhase 3\nKill the boss. There will be occasional adds. Not sure if they are HP percent or time-based. Some are dathors, others are some kind of shadow.\nGolem mechanics\nYou can ignore the golems by spreading your group out. The golems will path to wherever the most members of your group are. Use the bridge walls to keep all members of your party separated. Use ranged DPS and only go in to DPS when the golems are away from the MT. Then, once the golems start getting close to MT, move your close-range melee DPS back away to buy more distance.\nAfter Completion:\nLuclin, Mistress of Shadow says, 'It is decided as I expected it would be. There is one of you that I must speak to.' Luclin makes a small gesture and summons Loda Kai from his prison. 'Things must be made clear.'\nLuclin, Mistress of Shadow says, 'Child of Norrath, you and your people have shown to me that you are worthy creatures. Since your arrival here you have lived in harmony with this world. Your people have become part of the cycle here. You belong here now.'\nLuclin, Mistress of Shadow says, 'I have seen your secrets, child. I know who you are, what you desire, and what you fear. I like you, Loda Kai, and would make you an offer, here in front of your people and your city. I do so openly, as I have learned that not everything should be secret. Some words have greater power when shouted than when whispered. I have cut ties with my most important servant, my Knight of Shadow. I have sought someone to replace him for many of your generations. I would offer that title to you.'\nLoda Kai says, 'What, exactly, does that mean? That sounds too much like being a servant. What would you expect from me?'\nLuclin, Mistress of Shadow says, 'I would ask you to be my presence when needed, my sword when necessary. In exchange I can grant you the power to enforce my will and the understanding of my needs. You would transcend the mortal realm. You would live forever. And when I have no need of you, you would be free to do as you will. Of course, I would require that you do not act in opposition to my desires. What I offer you now I have only given to one other. I do not make this choice lightly, nor would I expect you to accept such an offer without consideration.'\nLuclin, Mistress of Shadow says, 'You will know things that few know. It is within my power to hear any words spoken in shadow, and deeds done in secret. Come with me now and I will give you a taste of that power, show you what I would need of you. Will you come? I invite you here, in sight of these people and your entire city so that you will know that I tell the truth.'\nLoda Kai glances around, 'It was you that stopped that Akheva's power, the one that would have destroyed us all. She said that you told the Akheva to destroy us. But you stopped her. Why? What is all this about?'\n[Wed Jun 28 22:59:15 2023] Luclin, Mistress of Shadow says, 'I simply showed my appreciation for the temple they rebuilt in my name. Their taking my visit as some sort of sign is their own choice, though I was not surprised by it. Very little surprises me. When Vius Vex tried to kill you, I was forced to interfere.'\nLuclin, Mistress of Shadow says, 'Now, come with me or not. We will talk and you will decide if you want to become my Knight, or you will return to your life and I will begin my search again.'\nLoda Kai pauses for a long moment. 'I'll go with you and see what you have to say. I'm not promising anything, but I will listen.'\n**Submitted by:** Cylius & Laurana\n- Shaded Specie [item=145000]",
