      },
      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shar Vahl, Divided [zone=1310]\n**Who:**\n- Khala Dun Bokh [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 116\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Fresh Rhinobeetle Eye [item=145137]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a rhinobeetle [npc=57930]\n- a rhinobeetle hatchling [npc=57931]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Shar Vahl, Divided (10 Points) [quest=12236]\n**Era:** | !Night of Shadows\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 6 19:13:28 2022\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Night of Shadows Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Khala Dun Bokh in Shar Vahl, Divided. You can find him at /waypoint -1121,135, -189 at the start of the bridge leading into Shar Vahl on the Shadeweaver side. He is on the find tool as well, CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Khala Dun Bokh'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'Greetings, traveler. If you are headed through these gates you should be aware that there are many [dangers] you may encounter. You'll also want to bring a [snack] as it's a bit of a trek from the Shar Vahl gates to Shadow Haven.'\nYou say, 'What dangers lurk beyond the gates?'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'While the [traitor] has been taken into custody, his [brigands] have gone rogue. There's also the issue of the [Shak Dratha].'\nYou say, 'Who is the traitor?'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'Loda Kai, of course. He was once a well-known Taruun, but he had disappeared, followed by many brigands appearing wearing his family crest. He has finally been apprehended, and we can only hope that things will return to normalcy soon.'\nYou say, 'What brigands do you speak of?'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'Brigands and poachers bearing Loda Kai's crest have become restless with the arrest of Loda Kai, as well as the halted trade caravans to Shadow Haven. They've become desperate and disorganized. If you're headed out these gates, watch your tail.'\nYou say, 'What are the Shak Dratha?'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'The Shak Dratha were long in a turf war with the Gor Taku, but the Gor Taku seem to have lost, as our scouts haven't seen them in Shadeweaver's Thicket for some time.'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'Greetings, traveler. If you are headed through these gates you should be aware that there are many [dangers] you may encounter. You'll also want to bring a [snack] as it's a bit of a trek from the Shar Vahl gates to Shadow Haven.'\nYou say, 'Where do you recommend a good snack?'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'There's a few places with some good food just north of the southern gate, such as Chialle's stall, but I personally enjoy a little bit directly from the Pit below. Are you familiar with [rhinobeetles]?'\nYou say, 'What about rhinobeetles?'\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'Their eyes are delectable and quite satisfying. Back in the day, I'd often send recruits down to get a few for me while I was at post.' Bokh considers for a brief moment. 'You know, they are sounding really good right now. Since I'm stuck up here, could you [snag] a handful for me?'\nYou say, 'I can snag a few.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Eyeing a Snack'.\nKhala Dun Bokh says, 'Thanks a lot. Bringing eight should get me through the shift. If you manage to get a few extra, you should give them a try. They're a great pick-me-up!'\n\n---\n\nKhala Dun Bokh is feeling snacky, but can't leave his post. He fondly remembers the rhinobeetle eyes he used to send recruits to get for him and requests a handful to get him through his shift.\nNote: These mobs are below the city go back to the a bridge and make your way down.\n1\\. Kill 8 rhinobeetles in the Pit 0/8 Shar Vahl, Divided\n2\\. Collect 8 Fresh Rhinobeetle Eyes for Bokh 0/8 Shar Vahl, Divided\n_The eyes are prelootable._\n3\\. Deliver 8 Fresh Rhinobeetle Eyes to Bokh 0/8 Shar Vahl, Divided\n\n---\n\nReward(s)\n118 plat 5 silver 6 copper\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Veludeus etc.",
